title: $:/config/ShortcutInfo/

outline-up: Outline: select the previous unit (a list above is selected as a whole)
outline-down: Outline: select the next unit (a whole list counts as one block)
outline-up-deep: Outline: select the previous unit, also inside lists
outline-down-deep: Outline: select the next unit, also inside lists
outline-parent: Outline: select the parent unit (item, list, heading)
outline-child: Outline: select the first child unit
outline-move-up: Outline: move the selected unit and its subtree above its previous sibling
outline-move-down: Outline: move the selected unit and its subtree below its next sibling
outline-indent: Outline: indent the selected unit and its subtree by one level
outline-promote: Outline: promote the selected unit and its subtree by one level
outline-edit: Outline: edit the selected unit in place
outline-menu: Outline: block menu - insert a new block after the selected unit, or turn it into another type
outline-open: Outline: open the transcluded tiddler of the selected unit in outline mode
outline-clear: Outline: clear the selection
outline-save: Outline editor: save the edit
outline-continue: Outline editor: save and start a new unit below (list items, headings, paragraphs); in the middle of a list item: split it at the caret
outline-newline: Outline editor: insert a line break
outline-cancel: Outline editor: discard the edit
outline-edit-up: Outline editor: save and edit the previous unit
outline-edit-down: Outline editor: save and edit the next unit
outline-help: Outline: show or hide the key overview
outline-delete: Outline: delete the selected unit (asks first)
outline-merge: Outline editor: at the start of a list item, merge it into the item above (an empty item is deleted)
outline-undo: Outline: undo the last change made in the outline
outline-redo: Outline: redo the last undone change
